    <skos:note>Example Implementations: Kurator/FilteredPush sci_name_qc Library (Morris &amp; Dou 2025)</skos:note>
    <skos:note>TG2 Validation NAME CODED Test Completeness CORE</skos:note>
    <skos:prefLabel>ValidationMethod: VALIDATION_KINGDOM_NOTEMPTY with Specification for: VALIDATION_KINGDOM_NOTEMPTY</skos:prefLabel>
